<title>FRANCE: Air France cuts flying time to Seoul.</title>
<headline>Air France cuts flying time to Seoul.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Air France said on Tuesday it cut flying time on its Paris-Seoul route by two hours 35 minutes to 11 hours after China authorised it to fly over the Beijing area.</p>
<p>The French national airline said China's permission allowed its three-weekly Airbus flight to Seoul to take a shorter, more southerly route.</p>
